{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type UsePrefetchInfiniteQueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey, TPageParam> = DistributiveOmit<InfiniteQueryExecuteOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey, TPageParam>, \"queryFn\"> & object;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/react-query/src/types.ts#L114","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/react-query/src/types.ts:114"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The options accepted by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"usePrefetchInfiniteQuery"},{"type":"text","value":" — everything you can pass to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryClient.infiniteQuery"},{"type":"text","value":",\nexcept "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryFn"},{"type":"text","value":" is required unless a default query function has been defined."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-declaration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Declaration"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"queryfn","children":[{"type":"text","value":"queryFn?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional queryFn?: Exclude<InfiniteQueryExecuteOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey, TPageParam>[\"queryFn\"], SkipToken>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"skipToken"},{"type":"text","value":" is not allowed as a value here — a prefetch always needs a query function to actually run,\nunless a default query function has been defined."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tqueryfndata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TQueryFnData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of a single page, as your "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryFn"},{"type":"text","value":" resolves it."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"terror","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TError"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"DefaultError.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DefaultError"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of errors your "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryFn"},{"type":"text","value":" may throw."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/InfiniteData.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"InfiniteData"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"data"},{"type":"text","value":" ends up as after "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":" runs. Defaults to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"InfiniteData<TQueryFnData>"},{"type":"text","value":",\nthe shape of all fetched pages plus their page params — a prefetch never reads "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"data"},{"type":"text","value":" back out, so this\nparameter only matters if you reuse these options elsewhere with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":" applied."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tquerykey","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TQueryKey"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryKey"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"QueryKey.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryKey"}]},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"QueryKey.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryKey"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of your "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryKey"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tpageparam","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TPageParam"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TPageParam"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of the parameter passed to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryFn"},{"type":"text","value":" to fetch a given page."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-declaration","text":"Type Declaration","level":2},{"id":"queryfn","text":"queryFn?","level":3},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tqueryfndata","text":"TQueryFnData","level":3},{"id":"terror","text":"TError","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"tquerykey","text":"TQueryKey","level":3},{"id":"tpageparam","text":"TPageParam","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype UsePrefetchInfiniteQueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey, TPageParam> = DistributiveOmit<InfiniteQueryExecuteOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey, TPageParam>, \"queryFn\"> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/react-query/src/types.ts:114](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/react-query/src/types.ts#L114)\n\nThe options accepted by `usePrefetchInfiniteQuery` — everything you can pass to `queryClient.infiniteQuery`,\nexcept `queryFn` is required unless a default query function has been defined.\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### queryFn?\n\n```ts\noptional queryFn?: Exclude<InfiniteQueryExecuteOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey, TPageParam>[\"queryFn\"], SkipToken>;\n```\n\n`skipToken` is not allowed as a value here — a prefetch always needs a query function to actually run,\nunless a default query function has been defined.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TQueryFnData\n\n`TQueryFnData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type of a single page, as your `queryFn` resolves it.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your `queryFn` may throw.\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = [`InfiniteData`](../interfaces/InfiniteData.md)\\<`TQueryFnData`\\>\n\nThe type `data` ends up as after `select` runs. Defaults to `InfiniteData<TQueryFnData>`,\nthe shape of all fetched pages plus their page params — a prefetch never reads `data` back out, so this\nparameter only matters if you reuse these options elsewhere with `select` applied.\n\n### TQueryKey\n\n`TQueryKey` *extends* [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md) = [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md)\n\nThe type of your `queryKey`.\n\n### TPageParam\n\n`TPageParam` = `unknown`\n\nThe type of the parameter passed to `queryFn` to fetch a given page.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: UsePrefetchInfiniteQueryOptions\ntitle: UsePrefetchInfiniteQueryOptions\n---\n\n```ts\ntype UsePrefetchInfiniteQueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey, TPageParam> = DistributiveOmit<InfiniteQueryExecuteOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey, TPageParam>, \"queryFn\"> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/react-query/src/types.ts:114](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/react-query/src/types.ts#L114)\n\nThe options accepted by `usePrefetchInfiniteQuery` — everything you can pass to `queryClient.infiniteQuery`,\nexcept `queryFn` is required unless a default query function has been defined.\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### queryFn?\n\n```ts\noptional queryFn?: Exclude<InfiniteQueryExecuteOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey, TPageParam>[\"queryFn\"], SkipToken>;\n```\n\n`skipToken` is not allowed as a value here — a prefetch always needs a query function to actually run,\nunless a default query function has been defined.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TQueryFnData\n\n`TQueryFnData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type of a single page, as your `queryFn` resolves it.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your `queryFn` may throw.\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = [`InfiniteData`](../interfaces/InfiniteData.md)\\<`TQueryFnData`\\>\n\nThe type `data` ends up as after `select` runs. Defaults to `InfiniteData<TQueryFnData>`,\nthe shape of all fetched pages plus their page params — a prefetch never reads `data` back out, so this\nparameter only matters if you reuse these options elsewhere with `select` applied.\n\n### TQueryKey\n\n`TQueryKey` *extends* [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md) = [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md)\n\nThe type of your `queryKey`.\n\n### TPageParam\n\n`TPageParam` = `unknown`\n\nThe type of the parameter passed to `queryFn` to fetch a given page.\n"}
